# Copy to `.env` (or `.env.local` to override locally).
#
# This value is PUBLIC — it is the browser-facing API origin, baked into the
# client bundle at build time by Vite. It is not a secret.
#
# `.env` is deliberately committed so the deployed build can resolve it; see the
# comment in .gitignore. A missing value here is not caught by the build, so the
# app would fall back to http://localhost:4000 and every request would fail.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=https://k1weekly-server.onrender.com
